    "Fossils & Resonators": "rev 28 (ask-01): now GENUINELY the currency bands verbatim, five-step scale with the floor on ORANGE — nothing lives on tan (FilterBlade Ruthless corroborates: their tan rung is commented out). Row keys are GLOBAL rung ids. Base re-tier (which fossil sits where) per ask-01's proposed table — code side owns the mapping. Icons: 0 Red Star / 1 Green Diamond / 2 Orange Diamond / none (pickup floor).",
    "Legacy": "border mark ONLY (150 150 150); items keep family/rarity look — retire the text ladder",
    "Deep tiers (all categories)": "audit finding A: replace desaturated Tier 6/7/8/12 with family hue at alpha cc on solid black, or emit nothing",
    "Net": "Ask 2: ONE fixed look per item-class net, emitted last ahead of the magenta. No ladder, no icon. Escalation (only if in-game salience fails): plate #301126ff.",
    "Equipment loudness": "rev 22: jewellery keeps bright rarity plates (loud, unchanged). Weapons/armour = rarity text on quiet #202020ff.",
    "Wombgifts": "rev 24: T1 reserved for the house chase pair (empty today — promote a base into it, don't restyle T2). T2 (all 4 bases) = black on blush 235 175 190, 11.41:1, FS45 — plate channel only, no text-hue collision. Net = the net look. Hide below.",
    "Authoring pass (rev 25)": "Heist Experimented + Trinkets = heist violet walk (trinket T0 lock = white-plate top) · Talismans = freed amethyst walk · Influenced = STATUS: influence border #966effff on rev-22 gear rows (5th reserved border use) · Campaign = one gear-rare row, declutters are Hides · Class Nets = the net accent 1:1 · Moon = league-gear icon shape. Memory-Stranded / ID-Mods dropped (no longer in repo).",
    "Talismans fallback": "Ships on amethyst 200 120 230 (confirmed). If the in-game eyeball vs heist violet fails: fallback = retired allflame violet #aa78ffff (262°, Δ40°, contrasts pre-measured) — never a small hue nudge.",
    "Prized Bases": "rev 26.1: 4-step ilvl walk — T0 perfect 86+ (white-plate top: dark verdigris on white, 0 Green Moon — rev 26.2) · T1 chase (bare plate, 1 Green Moon) · T2 good ilvl (tint) · T3 fringe (black). A category uses the top steps it earns, skips the rest (3 tiers typical). Icons stop below T1 (pickup floor). Hide tiers unchanged; per-base sounds stay item_overrides.",
    "rev 27": "Runegrafts = currency R1/R2 aliases (inline Diamond dropped). Heist markers = ONE tier. Heist family violet→scarlet #f06432ff (red-and-black identity); trinkets/experimented re-authored; heist deep greys still heal via finding A. Eyeball: black-on-scarlet vs currency R2 white-on-vermilion (Δ1° plates, opposite text polarity).",
