  "_rung_stamps": "rev 28 (ask-01 F1): every painted row carries _rung — the GLOBAL rung its recipe resolves to, or 'authored' for looks outside the global recipes (maps text-rank rows, gear rows, gems' Sharket-verbatim walk). Section-local R0..Rn labels are retired; assert routing against _rung, not against key names. A row whose live tier carries a winning inline style is a defect on the port side — reconcile toward the stamped row or file an ask.",
  "_beam_grammar": "rev 29 — beams (PlayEffect), new channel (shipped theme had 200 undifferentiated White beams): PERMANENT beam, colour = icon colour, at R0/R1/category tops (the stop-what-you're-doing band). TEMP beam at the loud-middle (R2/R3-position rows) — one flash to place the drop, no lingering clutter. NO beam at each family's lowest visible tier (icon alone carries findability) and on the quiet list. Nets: icon (2 Pink Cross — you must find what the filter can't value) but no beam."
